        <activityName xml:lang="en">xx Corrugated board, fresh fibre, single wall, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: xx Corrugated board, fresh fibre, single wall, at plant
na;
UUID: 1b87e2c2-9bec-343e-bac1-90333ca056bf
This module includes the production of corrugated board out of the corrugated base papers. The following steps are included: energy production, corrugated board production itself, waste water treatment.; Geography: Average data from 6 Swiss corrugated board producers
Location: Average data from 6 Swiss corrugated board producers
Technology: Average of the used technology within the examined Swiss producers
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: &lt;null&gt;
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_1b87e2c2-9bec-343e-bac1-90333ca056bf.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
